.TH batten-record-validate 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-record\-validate \- Run a declared tool row\*(Aqs `run` argv and record its exit code under the row\*(Aqs key
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten record validate\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIid\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run a declared tool row\*(Aqs `run` argv and record its exit code under the row\*(Aqs key
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIid\fR>
The `[[rule.tools]]` id whose argv runs and whose verdict is recorded
